; Short aliases of the English AutoCAD for the commands of the 0.8 ([0.8.1-RT3], work #930):
; EL ELLIPSE, T and MT MTEXT, ST STYLE, DLI DIMLINEAR, D DIMSTYLE, H HATCH, B BLOCK,
; I INSERT (alias column of docs/parita/comandi.md; DECISIONI.md, 2026-11-21, point 6).
; Each alias answers its first prompt, or shows its first message, so that the echo says
; which command started; then Esc leaves nothing and no undo step. The echo after
; Command: is the alias as typed. Prompts and messages from the cases of the 0.8 for the
; same commands: ellipse/esc-annulla, mtext/comando-opzioni, style/annulla-ripeti-esc,
; dimlinear/anteprima-esc-annulla, dimstyle/salva-esistente, hatch/errori-autocad,
; block/senza-oggetti-ed-esc, insert/errori-e-unita. An alias at Command: is the
; boundary of the pending case (docs/verifica/casi.md, point 2), so nothing changes before.
EL
0,0
!esc
T
0,0
!esc
MT
0,0
!esc
ST
Prova
!esc
DLI
0,0
!esc
D
!esc
H
!esc
B
Pezzo
!esc
I
Sconosciuto
!esc
